<% content_for :title, "Support evaluation lab — NavishAI" %>
<main class="page-shell introduction">
  <p class="eyebrow">Support evaluation lab</p>
  <h1>Company evidence.<br>Tests you can trust.</h1>
  <p>Turn your company's Support knowledge and history into tests for AI support systems.</p>
  <%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_path, class: "button button-primary" %>
  <% if FirstOwnerBootstrap.available? %>
    <%= link_to "First-time setup", new_setup_path, class: "button button-secondary" %>
  <% end %>
  <section class="section-block">
    <h2>The lab is being rebuilt</h2>
    <p>Upload company history, review scenarios, compile checks and calibrate them with expert labels. Local scripted runs can retain failures as regressions. HTTP targets need operator approval and your disclosure confirmation. Model judges are next.</p>
  </section>
</main>
